                <mxCell id="201" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The right hand side of this schema map is for freecreate writing content goals. You could duplicate this type of schema for other forms of media, with likely some variations and quirks depending on the format (visual art, audio, video)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The left hand side is for the &quot;Connect&quot; social media side of things, which I think, for convenience, should actually just remain as a branch of freecreate.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The goal is not to actively build this out now, but to add it on if and when it seems appropriate.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The concept of a creator profile is still apt for both.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
